(docs/BUGS_FOUND.md #117 - the register's exact repro, correctly closed
 with the blank line LANGUAGE.md requires to end a function body (the
 register's own fenced block omitted it, which silently folds every
 following line into the function and never runs them at all - a
 different failure from the address leak reported). With the body closed,
 appending a parameter's text into the caller's list through a function
 call already prints the value, not an address; pinned here so it cannot
 regress.)

